-will-reap-billions-from-tax-free-renewable-energy-bonds-1-4", "category": 5, "author": ["manager1"], "featured_image": "2026/06/07/Businessimg.jpg", "short_description": "How Wall Street Banks Will Reap Billions from Tax-Free Renewable Energy Bonds explains how major financial institutions can generate significant profits by financing, underwriting, trading, and managing tax-advantaged renewable energy bonds that support clean energy projects while benefiting from government incentives and lower tax obligations.", "blog_body": "How Wall Street Banks Will Reap Billions from Tax-Free Renewable Energy Bonds examines the financial opportunities created by tax-exempt renewable energy bonds and how investment banks position themselves to benefit from them. The topic explores how banks earn revenue through bond issuance, advisory services, underwriting fees, investment management, and market trading activities while helping fund renewable energy infrastructure such as solar, wind, and clean technology projects. It also highlights the role of government policies and tax incentives in attracting institutional investment and accelerating the transition toward sustainable energy, while raising discussions about who gains the most economic value from these public financing mechanisms.", "status": "Published", "is_featured": false, "created_at": "2026-06-07T05:41:53.243Z", "updated_at": "2026-06-23T11:07:26.035Z"}}, {"model": "blogs.blog", "pk": 5, "fields": {"title": "The Real Time AI Data Race is On", "slug": "the-real-time-ai-data-race-is-on", "category": 5, "author": ["djangoadmin"], "featured_image": "2026/06/07/Aidataimg.jpg", "short_description": "The Real Time AI Data Race is On highlights the growing competition among companies to collect, process, and analyze data instantly using artificial intelligence in order to make faster decisions, improve customer experiences, and gain a competitive advantage.", "blog_body": "The Real Time AI Data Race is On explores how organizations across industries are rapidly adopting real-time artificial intelligence systems to process massive amounts of data as events happen. Businesses are investing in technologies such as AI, machine learning, cloud computing, and streaming analytics to generate immediate insights and automate decision-making. This shift enables faster responses in areas like healthcare, finance, sports, cybersecurity, and customer engagement. The topic also examines challenges including data quality, privacy concerns, infrastructure scalability, and the increasing demand for accurate and continuous data processing to remain competitive in the AI-driven economy.", "status": "Published", "is_featured": true, "created_at": "2026-06-07T05:45:20.644Z", "updated_at": "2026-06-23T11:07:26.049Z"}}, {"model": "blogs.blog", "pk": 6, "fields": {"title": "Canada's population sees record growth as  immigrations rises", "slug": "canadas-population-sees-record-growth-as-immigrations-rises-6", "category": 2, "author": ["editor1"], "featured_image": "2026/06/07/Politics.jpg", "short_description": "Canada's Population Sees Record Growth as Immigration Rises discusses the rapid increase in Canada’s population driven largely by higher immigration levels, supporting economic growth, workforce expansion, and demographic development.", "blog_body": "Canada's Population Sees Record Growth as Immigration Rises explores how increased immigration contributed to one of the fastest periods of population growth in Canada’s history. The rise was supported by permanent residents, temporary workers, international students, and government immigration policies aimed at addressing labor shortages and supporting economic development. The topic examines the impact of population growth on housing, employment, public services, infrastructure, and long-term economic sustainability while also highlighting the opportunities and challenges created by a rapidly expanding population.", "status": "Published", "is_featured": true, "created_at": "2026-06-07T05:50:20.290Z", "updated_at": "2026-06-23T11:07:26.065Z"}}, {"model": "blogs.blog", "pk": 7, "fields": {"title": "Socially Responsible investing, marketed under the moniker", "slug": "socially-responsible-investing-marketed-under-the-moniker", "category": 1, "author": ["editor2"], "featured_image": "2026/06/07/Sportsimg.jpg", "short_description": "Socially Responsible Investing (SRI), marketed under the moniker refers to an investment approach that considers not only financial returns but also environmental, social, and ethical factors when selecting investments.", "blog_body": "Socially Responsible Investing (SRI), marketed under the moniker describes an investment strategy that integrates financial goals with social, environmental, and governance considerations. Often associated with sustainable investing, ethical investing, or ESG (Environmental, Social, and Governance) investing, this approach encourages investors to support companies that demonstrate responsible business practices while avoiding industries or activities considered harmful. SRI aims to create positive social impact alongside financial performance and has gained popularity among individuals and institutions seeking investments aligned with their values and long-term sustainability goals.", "status": "Published", "is_featured": true, "created_at": "2026-06-07T05:53:53.890Z", "updated_at": "2026-06-23T11:07:26.075Z"}}, {"model": "blogs.blog", "pk": 14, "fields": {"title": "mahesh bhai", "slug": "mahesh-bhai-14", "category": 5, "author": ["djangoadmin"], "featured_image": "2026/06/18/srinivas.img.jpeg", "short_description": "bhai from backend", "blog_body": "kjbsdciwdbnclkwnd", "status": "Published", "is_featured": true, "created_at": "2026-06-18T14:29:35.344Z", "updated_at": "2026-06-23T11:07:26.091Z"}}, {"model": "blogs.comment", "pk": 1, "fields": {"user": ["pavanking"], "blog": 5, "comment": "super", "created_at": "2026-06-18T14:44:25.446Z", "updated_at": "2026-06